        The root cause of the bug was the absence of necessary graph connections between the TCON TOP and the TCONs in the device tree, which led to improper functioning of the HDMI pipeline. The missing connections prevented the TCONs from communicating correctly with the HDMI input/output, resulting in potential display issues or failures in the HDMI functionality.

